  5496                                  ; try_handle_ali_line: line_buf holds a raw, not-yet-tokenized input
  5497                                  ; line. If it starts with the exact word "ali" followed by a name and
  5498                                  ; at least one command, stores the alias and returns al=1 (caller
  5499                                  ; should treat the line as fully handled and not process it further).
  5500                                  ; Otherwise returns al=0 and leaves line_buf untouched, so the caller
  5501                                  ; processes the line normally.
