 11472                                  ; fs_save: writes the OS volume ([boot_device], nodes 0..OS_NODES) then
 11473                                  ; every mounted volume back to its own device. Returns CF=0 on success,
 11474                                  ; CF=1 if the OS volume's disk isn't there/isn't responding. A mounted
 11475                                  ; volume that fails to write is left mounted (best effort; sync still
