 12381                                  ; cmd_write: write <path> <content> creates the file (or overwrites an
 12382                                  ; existing file's content). It's meant to be used through a "~" pipe -
 12383                                  ; "show hi ~ write file.txt" writes "hi" to file.txt - but also works
 12384                                  ; standalone: write file.txt "some text".
