 12456                                  ; ------------------------------------------------------------
 12457                                  ; wig time: the "widget" command. Draws a live clock in the top-right
 12458                                  ; corner of the screen that updates every second, until Esc is pressed.
 12459                                  ; ------------------------------------------------------------
 12460                                  
 12461                                  ; wig_draw_clock: right-aligns "HH:MM:SS" at row 0 of the screen, writing
 12462                                  ; straight to VGA memory so the shell's cursor and scrollback stay put.
 12463                                  wig_draw_clock:
 12464 000099DF 50                          push rax
 12465 000099E0 53                          push rbx
 12466 000099E1 51                          push rcx
