   656 0000A2F2 415F                <1>     pop r15
   657 0000A2F4 415E                <1>     pop r14
   658 0000A2F6 415D                <1>     pop r13
   659 0000A2F8 415C                <1>     pop r12
   660 0000A2FA 5B                  <1>     pop rbx
   661 0000A2FB C3                  <1>     ret
   662                              <1> 
   663                              <1> ; ------------------------------------------------------------
   664                              <1> ; party_exec_stmts: executes statements starting at token r13 until
   665                              <1> ; it reaches a token whose type equals r14 (the "stop token" - callers
   666                              <1> ; pass TOK_EOF for the top level, TOK_RBRACE for a block body), or
   667                              <1> ; hits an error, or the running script is killed (Esc). Does NOT
   668                              <1> ; consume the stop token itself - the caller decides what to do with
   669                              <1> ; it. Recurses into itself for a while-loop's body.
   670                              <1> ; In: r13 = starting token index, r14 = stop token type.
   671                              <1> ; Out: r13 = index of the stop token (success), or of the offending
   672                              <1> ; token (error). party_exec_ok is left at 1 on success/kill, set to 0
   673                              <1> ; on error (+ party_error_line). Clobbers rax, rbx, r8-r11, r15.
   674                              <1> ; ------------------------------------------------------------
