 13355                                  
 13356                                  ; scrollback_view_up: Ctrl+Up. On the first press (scroll_offset==0),
 13357                                  ; snapshots the current live screen so it can be exactly restored later,
 13358                                  ; then scrolls the view back one more line (capped at what's stored).
 13359                                  scrollback_view_up:
 13360 00014776 50                          push rax
 13361 00014777 51                          push rcx
 13362 00014778 56                          push rsi
 13363 00014779 57                          push rdi
