 13375                                  
 13376 000147A9 5F                          pop rdi
 13377 000147AA 5E                          pop rsi
 13378 000147AB 59                          pop rcx
 13379 000147AC 58                          pop rax
 13380 000147AD C3                          ret
 13381                                  
 13382                                  ; scrollback_view_down: Ctrl+Down. Scrolls the view one line back toward
 13383                                  ; the live screen (a no-op once already live).
 13384                                  scrollback_view_down:
